## SECTION 15: Weak Concepts High-Yield Remediation Card (`WeakConceptsCard.tsx`)

### Screen Location & Visual Focus:
- Bottom grid, column 2.
- An alert-accented card with an amber/rose header: *"High-Yield Remediation Targets"*.
- Ranked list of the student's weakest concepts:
  - **The Chain Rule for Composite Functions** (Mastery: 29% • Critical Priority)
  - **The Squeeze Theorem & Special Limits** (Mastery: 34% • High Priority)
  - **Eigenvalues & Characteristic Polynomials** (Mastery: 38% • Moderate Priority)
