### Pedagogical & Product Purpose:
This is where exam scores are won. In competitive exams, score improvements do not come from reviewing topics the student already finds easy. They come from converting 30% weak concepts into 80% solid concepts. This card continuously highlights the lowest-hanging fruit.

### Presenter Spoken Script:
> "If you ask an experienced exam tutor where a student should spend their next hour, they will tell you: 'Work on your weakest links.'
> This card automatically isolates concepts with a Bayesian mastery below 40%. 
> Instead of letting the student avoid 'The Squeeze Theorem' because it feels uncomfortable, the system keeps it prominently surfaced with a 1-click 'Practice' trigger."

