  - `Submit Answer` button (primary electric cyan with keyboard shortcut `Enter`).

### Pedagogical & Product Purpose:
Provides an uncluttered, distraction-free environment optimized for high-intensity problem solving. Supports both multiple-choice and open-ended input modes to simulate realistic exam conditions.

### Presenter Spoken Script:
